      <p class="story-caption">Successful autonomous landing in the 3D MuJoCo environment</p>
      -->
      <p class="story-caption">Add 3D landing demo video here: public/assets/</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story-section">
    <h2>Results & Takeaways</h2>
    <p>
      The final DDPG agent achieves reliable soft landings with fuel-efficient trajectories. The hybrid
      controller approach was essential — pure RL struggled with attitude control, while the PD layer
      provided the stability the RL agent could build on top of.
    </p>
    <p>
      This project deepened my understanding of sim-to-real transfer challenges and reinforced my
      interest in autonomous spacecraft systems. The next step would be domain randomization to prepare
      for transfer to actual flight hardware.
    </p>
  </section>

</ProjectLayout>
